This self-dedication means that the CC0-A license, through its own terms, releases
its own text into the public domain. This ensures that the license text itself
remains freely available for anyone to copy, distribute, and use, regardless of
any modifications to the CC0-A license for other works.

This dedication applies only to this license text itself, not to any Work
licensed under CC0-A.

